26. Its capital, largest city and main…","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/France","source":"Wikipedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","iso2":"FR"},{"title":"Iran","extract":"Iran, officially the Islamic Republic of Iran, and historically known as Persia, is a country in West Asia. It borders Iraq to the west; Turkey, Azerbaijan, and Armenia to the northwest; the Caspian Sea to the north, Turkmenistan to the northeast; Afghanistan to the east; Pakistan to the southeast; and the Gulf of Oman and the Persian Gulf to the south. With a population of over 92 million, Iran ranks 17th globally in both geographic size and population. It is divided into five regions with 31 provinces. Tehran is the nation's capital and largest city and serves as its primary economic center.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iran","source":"Wikipedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","iso2":"IR"}],"arc":{"reports":68,"first_seen":"2026-10-12T16:16:00Z","first_title":"Bulletin world briefing: Major cyberattack in France and Zelensky tells Trump to act","first_url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNMWJaT2JfY0VZdkVBMlA0ZWhyVFBmMGk1d3FuZU1VVFh0bVgtSnJJQ1NFQWhjT19yYU8zaEM5MXJUcG9uVmNidm9URHppeE9mOElYQUF5V2J5RFp0S09iS3JieWtxMmFJREJPQ3hxbldNMHJuQ05kUTdwV1RvbGpzajlkZThSTEhtMFFDM0p3QzFTVkZGU2NPZS01RXVZTjJId1h5ek9pMTY1OURabGc?oc=5","first_publisher":"inkl","earlier":[{"id":"e_0319c60d1064","title":"France threatens actions against Iran over supermarket cyberattacks","date":"2026-11-10T07:43:55Z","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxQRjZaQldBYUdjMlVTNkFSMm9ORXA5VnBHZnF2N21FR0NZb3Fvc1FBQlkyamRibDBtQzVEdHlYMnZtX1E5bWdianVhaHlPV3lJU1BMdVVrNDhveWN4UXM4SHBXUG1xUjZLVUNQNHdYYVhyWVBvVXpSNFJxVjU5T2ZXZGtnOG1jZGJOLW5JYnhlNHo1MjFFMnZvaW5tT3hFLWo2MXhreVJ3M2dldjBj?oc=5","publisher":"France 24","verification":"multi_source_reporting"},{"id":"e_14f773609728","title":"France rules 'nothing out' in response to suspected Iran-linked cyberattack","date":"2026-11-10T08:00:00Z","url":"https